27	  doc: '.claudinite/local/packs/vascular-coloring/RULES.md',
28	  why: 'an uncalibrated figure does not fail — it silently reports "um n/a" and drops out of every length and density number, so a panel added without its bar measurement quietly shrinks the result set',
29	
